<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n60822" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κῠν-άς</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">άδος</span>,
		pecul. fem. of <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κύνεος</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>of a dog</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡμέραι κ.</span>
			<i>the dog</i>-days, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.380d
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> mostly as
				Subst., </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>1.</b>
			(sc. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θρίξ</span>), <i>dog's hair</i>, of
			a bad fleece, <i><span class="en">
				Theoc.
				15.19
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κυνάρα</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b> among the Spartans, 
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀπομαγδαλιά</span>
			 (q.v.), <i><span class="en">
				Polem.Hist.
				77
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Poll.
				6.93
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>4.</b> kind of
				<i>nail</i>, Sch.<i><span class="en">
				Od.
				7.91
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Eust.
				1570.48
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
